# Push to live

When the user says **push to live**, **deploy**, **go live**, **push the update to live**, or similar:

1. Open and follow **[docs/DEPLOY.md](docs/DEPLOY.md)** — execute the checklist, do not only summarize it.
2. Run `./deploy-sj.sh` from the repo root unless the user asked for a dry-run or pre-flight only.
3. Never upload `.env` or production SQLite (`data/*.db`). The deploy script excludes these by design.
4. After deploy, verify `https://roammax.ca` and report success or failure with curl/SSH output.

If deploy fails, diagnose (missing `.deployignore`, SSH/VPN, rsync errors) and fix before retrying.
